# CODEOWNERS - path-specific review requirements.
# GitHub matches the LAST matching pattern, so order matters.
#
# Solo maintainer until a second maintainer joins. Required-review
# count stays at 0 in branch protection; CODEOWNERS exists so that
# regatta's own `verifyrepo` audit (P2 canonical recipe) has a target
# to assert against, and so the moment a second maintainer is added,
# code-owner reviews become enforceable with one config flip.

* @trilamsr

# Governance & policy
/LICENSE                  @trilamsr
/PRINCIPLES.md            @trilamsr
/STYLE.md                 @trilamsr
/AGENTS.md                @trilamsr
/CODEOWNERS               @trilamsr

# Agent-facing instructions and skills.
# A lesson-capture or skill edit landing without maintainer review
# would taint every subsequent agent run via the substrate they
# auto-load.
/.claude/skills/**        @trilamsr

# CI / supply chain
/.github/                 @trilamsr
/.githooks/               @trilamsr
/Makefile                 @trilamsr
/go.mod                   @trilamsr
/go.sum                   @trilamsr
/.golangci.yml            @trilamsr

# Regatta normative surface
/schemas/                 @trilamsr
/gates/                   @trilamsr
/docs/design.md           @trilamsr
/docs/incidents.md        @trilamsr
